OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786886309
OL,3,CPolice arrest alleged driver in 100mph
OL,4,Cstolen Amazon van pursuit
OL,6,FA suspected thief was arrested after
OL,7,Fleading traffic police on a 100mph
OL,8,Fchase in a stolen Amazon delivery van.
OL,10,FThe 25-year-old was held after
OL,11,Fofficers pursued the van from Wigan,
OL,12,Fin Greater Manchester, through Bolton
OL,13,Fand into Chorley in Lancashire, where
OL,14,Fthe van crashed into pedestrian
OL,15,Fbarriers and a vehicle stopped at
OL,16,Ftraffic lights.
OL,18,FPolice had received a call at around
OL,19,F6.23pm on Wednesday 12 August to
OL,20,Freport the Amazon van carrying #1,000
OL,21,Fworth of parcels had been stolen.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
