OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786886309
OL,3,CPolice arrest alleged driver in 100mph
OL,4,Cstolen Amazon van pursuit
OL,6,FOfficers located the vehicle within 15
OL,7,Fminutes and began following. They
OL,8,Fattempted to stop the van without a
OL,9,Fpursuit, but the driver made off at
OL,10,Fspeed.
OL,12,FPolice said over the course of the
OL,13,Fnext 40 minutes, the vehicle went
OL,14,Fthree times over the speed limit,
OL,15,Freaching around 100mph, injured a
OL,16,Fcyclist and caused significant damage
OL,17,Fto multiple pieces of street furniture.
OL,19,FNo serious injuries were reported.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786886309
OL,3,CPolice arrest alleged driver in 100mph
OL,4,Cstolen Amazon van pursuit
OL,6,FThe suspect was arrested at the scene
OL,7,Fof the crash which ended the pursuit
OL,8,Fon suspicion of theft of a motor
OL,9,Fvehicle, dangerous driving, failure to
OL,10,Fstop, driving under the influence of a
OL,11,Fcontrolled substance and possession of
OL,12,FClass A and C drugs.
OL,14,FHe has been bailed pending further
OL,15,Finquiries.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786886309
OL,3,CPolice arrest alleged driver in 100mph
OL,4,Cstolen Amazon van pursuit
OL,6,FPc Nat Mannyng, from the transport
OL,7,Funit at Greater Manchester Police,
OL,8,Fsaid: "This was an extremely dangerous
OL,9,Fincident which saw a vehicle reaching
OL,10,Fspeeds of 100mph through residential
OL,11,Fstreets where families, pedestrians
OL,12,Fand other road users were going about
OL,13,Ftheir daily lives.
OL,15,F"The driver showed a complete
OL,16,Fdisregard for public safety and
OL,17,Finnocent members of the public were
OL,18,Fharmed as a result of his actions.
OL,26,@pD@GOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786886309
OL,3,CPolice arrest alleged driver in 100mph
OL,4,Cstolen Amazon van pursuit
OL,6,F"Thankfully, there were only minor
OL,7,Fphysical injuries but his behaviour
OL,8,Fcould have resulted in a serious
OL,9,Fcollision.
OL,11,F"Our officers are trained to
OL,12,Fcontinually assess the risks involved
OL,13,Fin any pursuit and the decision-making
OL,14,Fthroughout this incident was focused
OL,15,Fon protecting the public and ensuring
OL,16,Fthe situation was brought to a safe
OL,17,Fconclusion.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786886309
OL,3,CPolice arrest alleged driver in 100mph
OL,4,Cstolen Amazon van pursuit
OL,6,F"We will continue to take robust
OL,7,Faction against those who choose to put
OL,8,Flives at risk on our roads, and we
OL,9,Fhope this outcome sends a clear
OL,10,Fmessage that these offences will not
OL,11,Fbe tolerated."
OL,13,FWant more on the issues affecting the
OL,14,FNorth? Our podcast, From the North
OL,15,Fanswers the questions that matter to
OL,16,Four region.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@NO]
